      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "HUONG DAN NHANH\n\n1. Load Checkpoint: chon Juggernaut-XL (hoac sd_xl_base_1.0).\n2. Load LoRA: chon pixel-art-xl. O nao do nghia la ten file khac may ban, bam vao o do va chon lai.\n3. Prompt: chi doi phan dau (chu the), giu nguyen phan phong cach phia sau de cac anh dong bo.\n4. Bam Run. Anh luu trong thu muc output cua ComfyUI, ten bat dau bang bnhon_.\n\nCHU THE GOI Y (thay cho 'old wooden kitchen cabinet'):\n- crate_house: old wooden kitchen cabinet\n- crate_medical: white metal medical cabinet with red cross\n- crate_seed: wooden crate full of seed bags\n- crate_weapon: green military ammo crate\n- zombie_walker: shambling zombie in torn clothes, full body, facing down\n- player: young survivor with backpack, full body, facing down\n- floor: seamless tileable cracked concrete ground texture, top-down, no objects, fills the whole image\n- wall: seamless tileable weathered brick wall top, top-down, no objects, fills the whole image\n(voi floor va wall: xoa 'single object centered, plain white background' khoi prompt)\n\nNEU ANH GIONG ANH CHUP: tang strength LoRA len 1.3.\nNEU HET BO NHO (out of memory): giam batch_size ve 1.\n\nSAU KHI CHON ANH: thu nho 1024 -> 128 (Nearest Neighbor), xoa nen trang, luu PNG dung ten file,\nchep vao Assets/_Project/Resources/Sprites/ trong repo bnhon4."
      ],
      "title": "Huong dan",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
